tlas/texas/milam-county"],["ARC or PLC in Milam County","/arc-plc/texas/milam-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Milam County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids May to June and June to July each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of the 75 years. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value got 177% of normal in May to June but just 35% in November to December. Grid 12731 had its driest year in 1954 at 40% of normal.</p>"}
